1
00:00:12,048 --> 00:00:16,604
Adrien, pourrais-tu me rendre un petit service ?
Adrien, could you do me a small favour?

2
00:00:16,704 --> 00:00:19,796
Bien sûr, dis-moi.
Of course, tell me.

3
00:00:19,896 --> 00:00:24,548
Ça te dérange si j'emprunte ton vélo ce week-end ?
Do you mind if I borrow your bike this weekend?

4
00:00:24,648 --> 00:00:32,060
Pas du tout. Je te le prête volontiers. Je te le donne demain soir.
Not at all. I'll gladly lend it to you. I'll give it to you tomorrow evening.

5
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:37,652
Merci ! Je te le rends lundi matin sans faute.
Thanks! I'll give it back to you on Monday morning without fail.

6
00:00:37,752 --> 00:00:44,756
Pas de souci. Mais attention aux pneus, je les ai changés la semaine dernière.
No worries. But be careful with the tyres, I changed them last week.
